problem P1:
  "根拠経路が長くなるときの信頼度劣化を確認する"

evidence EV1:
  "検証済みの入力根拠"

evidence EV2:
  "別経路だが独立性は未確認の入力根拠"

decision D1 based_on P1, EV1, EV2:
  "入力根拠から最初の判断を導く"

decision D2 based_on D1:
  "最初の判断を要約して結論にする"

confidence EV1:
  keyword strong_assumption

confidence EV1 -> D1:
  keyword approximate_inference

confidence EV2:
  keyword common_fact

confidence EV2 -> D1:
  keyword reliable_inference

confidence D1 -> D2:
  default

declared_confidence D2:
  keyword rough_assumption

query Q1:
  .document.confidence_results[]
